import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="August 14, 2026">
  <p>
    My Birdhouse ("we", "us", "our") is a BC Sole Proprietorship based in
    Maple Ridge, British Columbia, providing smart home integration and
    consulting services. This policy explains what personal information we
    collect through mybirdhouse.ca, how we use it, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you use our contact or quote request form, we collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Phone number (if you choose to provide it)</li>
    <li>Any details you include in your message</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not require an account to browse this site, and we do not collect
    payment information here — pricing and payment are handled directly with
    you once a project is confirmed.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your inquiry and provide a quote</li>
    <li>To schedule and coordinate an installation, if you become a client</li>
    <li>To send you information you've directly asked for</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third
    parties, and we do not use it for advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services we use</h2>
  <p>
    Our contact form is processed by <strong>Formspree</strong>, a
    third-party form-handling service, which delivers your message to our
    inbox. Our site is hosted and secured through
    <strong>Cloudflare</strong>, which may set minimal technical cookies to
    protect the site from abuse — see our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>
    for details. Neither service is used by us for advertising or tracking.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep messages and contact details for as long as reasonably needed to
    respond to your inquiry or service your project, and for basic
    bookkeeping and legal record-keeping afterward. You can ask us to delete
    your information at any time (see below).
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under Canadian privacy law (PIPEDA and BC's Personal Information
    Protection Act), you can ask us what personal information we hold about
    you, request a correction, or request that it be deleted. To do so,
    email <a href="mailto:info@mybirdhouse.ca">info@mybirdhouse.ca</a> — we'll
    respond within a reasonable time.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as our business grows. Material changes will
    be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
